      "share.home.email.subject": {"en":"Thought of you: the Young Dems in Seminole","es":"Me acordé de ti: los Young Dems de Seminole"},
      "share.home.email.body": {"en":"Hi,\n\nI came across the Young Democrats of Seminole County and thought of you. Their site has upcoming meetups, voting help in plain words (in English and Spanish), and a one-minute quiz that tells you which local issue is yours.\n\nHave a look: {link}\n\nWant to go to something together?","es":"Hola:\n\nEncontré a los Young Democrats of Seminole County y me acordé de ti. En su sitio hay reuniones próximas, ayuda para votar sin enredos (en inglés y en español) y un quiz de un minuto que te dice cuál tema local es el tuyo.\n\nÉchale un vistazo: {link}\n\n¿Te animas a ir conmigo a algo?"},
